<title>MEXICO: Mexico says new TIIE 91-day rate begins 26.15 pct [CORRECTED 20:35 GMT].</title>
<headline>Mexico says new TIIE 91-day rate begins 26.15 pct [CORRECTED 20:35 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to TIIE in title and throughout text from TIIP).</p>
<p>Mexico began calculating a 91-day version of the TIIE interbank interest rate Wednesday, which stood at 26.15 percent, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The new 91-day TIIE, like its 28-day stablemate, will be revised weekly.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
</text>
